  data: {
    LLM: "Dealer deals all 16 cards one at a time (4 each). Player to dealer's left leads. Must follow suit; all trumps count as one suit. Must beat the highest card in the trick if possible. Winner of each trick leads to the next. Four tricks; team with at least 53 of 104 points wins. Tie 52-52: side that announced last double loses, or if no double the old team or lone player loses.",
